# Sandcastle env (PRD #1, GitHub #2). EnvResolver reads ONLY <repoRoot>/.sandcastle/.env
# and forwards ONLY keys DECLARED here, resolving values from process.env
# (precedence: this file > process.env). CHOSEN: inherit host env — keep all
# keys BLANK; export real values in the shell that runs `npm run go`.
#
# Evidence Factory has NO per-project lab credentials (no security/secrets.env)
# — the only keys the harness needs are the three agent-auth vars below.
#
# In the run shell (on the VM, before `npm run go`):
#   . ~/.sandcastle-creds-max         # or ~/.sandcastle-creds-api for the paid fallback
#   export GH_TOKEN="$(gh auth token)"  # if not already set by the creds file
#
# Setup instructions: docs/agents/sandcastle-runbook.md (this repo).
# Canonical operations runbook for the VM: see the agentic-ai repo at
# context/development/operator/sandcastle-on-vm-runbook.md (§3 SSH command
# shapes, §6 per-project onboarding, §7 failure modes).

# --- agent auth (the entire keyset for Evidence Factory) ---
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
GH_TOKEN=
